{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FAp7aUD7ams2vnLtmUT6iU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Prompts\n2\t\n3\tAppend-only, written by `.claude/hooks/log-prompt.sh`. Do not edit past entries.\n4\t\n5\t## 2026-09-27T23:08:27Z · c726058a\n6\t\n7\t```text\n8\t/refine a docs/specs/SPEC.v1-todo-list-cli-mvp.md for creating a todo list app. Main objective is a simple setup but well integratable into CI with well set up test infrastructure using our ways of working for a scala pure fp cats style. The output should be colored and well structured, it should be possible to interface the todo list app with yaml and rich text directly. Configuration is pure cli args only, no env vars and no other config options. A local todo file in the current directory is the default path, create it when there is none, and on reads complain about a missing file or parameter.\n9\t```\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c726058a-6325-46ce-ad49-865933d37083","uuid":"68baf23f-e187-4d9c-ad49-1a2cbc73a865","timestamp":"2026-09-27T23:08:35.654Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/isaiasbartelborth/Projects/hivemind/todo-list-cli/develop/docs/PROMPTS.md","content":"# Prompts\n\nAppend-only, written by `.claude/hooks/log-prompt.sh`. Do not edit past entries.\n\n## 2026-09-27T23:08:27Z · c726058a\n\n```text\n/refine a docs/specs/SPEC.v1-todo-list-cli-mvp.md for creating a todo list app. Main objective is a simple setup but well integratable into CI with well set up test infrastructure using our ways of working for a scala pure fp cats style. The output should be colored and well structured, it should be possible to interface the todo list app with yaml and rich text directly. Configuration is pure cli args only, no env vars and no other config options. A local todo file in the current directory is the default path, create it when there is none, and on reads complain about a missing file or parameter.\n```\n","numLines":10,